  "prefLabel": "Odb 206.03 Board Review",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Odb 206.03 Board Review.\n\n(a) Upon receipt of a petition to adopt, amend, or repeal a rule, the board shall proceed in accordance with RSA 541-A: 4, I.\n\n(b) The petition shall be granted and a rulemaking proceeding shall be initiated if the board determines that the proposed action is:\n\n(1) Consistent with state and federal law and policy; and\n\n(2) Necessary to the efficient and effective implementation of the rules that are the subject of the action.\n\nSource. #8490-A, eff 11-22-05; ss by #12941, eff 12-15-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/odb100-600.html"
}
